   "text": "Amniotic Fluid"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- In the uterus the developing embryo is surrounded by **amniotic fluid**\n\n  - Amniotic fluid is contained within the** amniotic membrane**, also known as the **amniotic sac**\n- The amniotic fluid** protects the embryo/fetus** during development by cushioning it from bumps** **when the mother moves around"
  },
